sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Applicant
  participant UI as React Portal
  participant API as Express API
  participant EL as eligibility.service
  participant ME as merit.service
  participant CH as challan.service
  participant DB as MySQL (Prisma)
  actor C as Clerk

  A->>UI: Register account
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/register
  API->>DB: create user + applicant role
  API-->>UI: JWT token

  A->>UI: Apply wizard steps 1-3
  UI->>API: POST /api/admissions/check-eligibility
  API->>EL: checkEligibility(program, group, marks)
  EL->>DB: read program_eligibilities, min_percentage
  EL-->>API: eligible / reason
  API-->>UI: eligibility result

  A->>UI: Upload required documents (step 4)
  UI->>API: POST /api/admissions/:id/documents
  API->>DB: store application_documents (private storage)

  A->>UI: Review and submit (step 5)
  UI->>API: POST /api/admissions/applications
  API->>DB: application status = submitted
  API-->>A: notification "Application received"

  C->>UI: Open verification queue
  UI->>API: GET /api/admissions/queue
  C->>UI: Verify each document
  UI->>API: PUT /api/admissions/documents/:id/verify
  API->>DB: document status = verified
  API->>DB: application status = verified

  C->>UI: Generate merit list
  UI->>API: POST /api/merit/generate
  API->>ME: generateMeritList(cycle, program, seats)
  ME->>DB: read verified + waitlisted pool
  ME->>ME: score = 0.30*matric% + 0.70*inter% (+Hafiz bonus)
  ME->>ME: sort by score, inter%, matric%, dob, application_no
  ME->>DB: create merit_list + merit_list_entries
  ME-->>API: list created
  C->>UI: Publish list
  UI->>API: PUT /api/merit/:id/publish
  API->>DB: entries selected / waitlisted
  API-->>A: notification "You are selected"

  API->>CH: issueChallan(application)
  CH->>DB: create challan + challan_items
  A->>UI: Download challan
  A->>A: Pay at Bank of Punjab, obtain counterfoil

  C->>UI: Verify paid challan
  UI->>API: PUT /api/challans/:id/verify
  API->>CH: verifyChallan(challanId, clerkUserId)
  CH->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  CH->>CH: generateRollNumber(program, session)
  CH->>DB: create student record
  CH->>DB: grant student role, drop applicant role
  CH->>DB: application status = enrolled
  CH->>DB: merit entry status = admitted
  CH->>DB: COMMIT
  CH-->>A: notification "Admission confirmed, roll no issued"
